-- page.html
<html>
<head>
<title>Generators</title>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Generators in Icon</h1>
<p>A procedure that suspends produces each of its results in turn:</p>
<pre>
<span style="color: #008800;font-weight: bold">procedure</span><span style=""> </span><span style="">upto_n</span><span style="">(</span><span style="">n</span><span style="">)</span>
<span style="">  </span><span style="color: #008800;font-weight: bold">local</span><span style=""> </span><span style="">i</span>
<span style="">  </span><span style="color: #008800;font-weight: bold">every</span><span style=""> </span><span style="">i</span><span style=""> </span><span style="color: #0066bb;font-weight: bold">:=</span><span style=""> </span><span style="color: #0000dd;font-weight: bold">1</span><span style=""> </span><span style="color: #008800;font-weight: bold">to</span><span style=""> </span><span style="">n</span><span style=""> </span><span style="color: #008800;font-weight: bold">do</span><span style=""> </span><span style="color: #008800;font-weight: bold">suspend</span><span style=""> </span><span style="">i</span>
<span style="color: #008800;font-weight: bold">end</span>

<span style="color: #008800;font-weight: bold">procedure</span><span style=""> </span><span style="">main</span><span style="">(</span><span style="">)</span>
<span style="">  </span><span style="color: #008800;font-weight: bold">every</span><span style=""> </span><span style="">write</span><span style="">(</span><span style="">upto_n</span><span style="">(</span><span style="color: #0000dd;font-weight: bold">3</span><span style="">)</span><span style=""> </span><span style="color: #0066bb;font-weight: bold"><</span><span style=""> </span><span style="color: #0000dd;font-weight: bold">3</span><span style=""> </span><span style="color: #0066bb;font-weight: bold">&</span><span style=""> </span><span style="color: #dd2200;background-color: #fff0f0">"small"</span><span style="">)</span>
<span style="">  </span><span style="color: #008800;font-weight: bold">if</span><span style=""> </span><span style="color: #0066bb;font-weight: bold">*</span><span style="color: #dd2200;background-color: #fff0f0">"abc"</span><span style=""> </span><span style="color: #0066bb;font-weight: bold">></span><span style=""> </span><span style="color: #0000dd;font-weight: bold">2</span><span style=""> </span><span style="color: #008800;font-weight: bold">then</span><span style=""> </span><span style="">write</span><span style="">(</span><span style="color: #dd2200;background-color: #fff0f0">"long"</span><span style="">)</span>
<span style="color: #008800;font-weight: bold">end</span>
</pre>
<p>The same idea in Ruby, left as it stands:</p>
<pre ruby>
def upto(n) = (1..n).each { |i| yield i }
</pre>
<p>Strings are scanned with <code>?</code>:</p>
<pre>
<span style="color: #dd2200;background-color: #fff0f0">"hello world"</span><span style=""> </span><span style="color: #0066bb;font-weight: bold">?</span><span style=""> </span><span style="color: #008800;font-weight: bold">while</span><span style=""> </span><span style="">tab</span><span style="">(</span><span style="">upto</span><span style="">(</span><span style="color: #003388">&letters</span><span style="">)</span><span style="">)</span><span style=""> </span><span style="color: #008800;font-weight: bold">do</span><span style=""> </span><span style="">write</span><span style="">(</span><span style="">tab</span><span style="">(</span><span style="">many</span><span style="">(</span><span style="color: #003388">&letters</span><span style="">)</span><span style="">)</span><span style="">)</span>
</pre>
</body>
</html>
